    "shortExplanation": "3 is \"tree\", 5 is \"fife\", 9 is \"niner\". All other digits are said normally.",
    "example": "Tree, fife, niner",
    "whyItMatters": "These forms stay clear on a noisy radio and for non-native speakers."
